{"symbol":"ONO.WA","area":"poland","updated":"2026-11-09T19:55:10Z","info":{"address1":"ul. Dyrekcyjna 6","city":"Chorzów","zip":"41-506","country":"Poland","phone":"48 32 793 72 71","website":"https://onesano.pl","industry":"Chemicals","industryKey":"chemicals","industryDisp":"Chemicals","sector":"Basic Materials","sectorKey":"basic-materials","sectorDisp":"Basic Materials","longBusinessSummary":"onesano S.A. engages in the production of products related to nutritional cycle, from agricultural production, through animal breeding, to dietetics and human supplementation in Poland. The company offers omega-3, 6, and 9 fatty acids; postbiotic Yarrowia lipolytica Novel Food, solutions in animal nutrition and dietetics; solutions in the field of bioremediation for hydrocarbon-contaminated soil based on the unique postbiotic Yarrowia lipolytica; veterinary products. It also provides dietary supplements and nutraceuticals under the EstroVita and PostVital brands; veterinary products under the Equinox and Canifelox brands; fortified foods and feed products; and natural agricultural products, as well as the production of contract brands and food raw materials. It sells its products through chain pharmacies, pharmaceutical wholesalers, drugstores, and develops sales through e-commerce platforms. The company was formerly known as Skotan SA and changed its name to onesano S.A. in March 2023. onesano S.A. was incorporated in 2001 and is headquartered in Chorzów, Poland.","fullTimeEmployees":42,"companyOfficers":[{"maxAge":1,"name":"Ms. Dominika  Kowalczyk","title":"President of the Management Board","exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Piotr  Krzak","title":"Operations Manager","exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Wioletta  Syposz","title":"Chief Accountant","exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Slawomir  Paluch","title":"Head of Production & Technical Department","exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"ma